.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# App data (dev) — repo-root only. NOTE: the pattern must stay root-anchored
# (`/data/`), otherwise it also swallows `core/kb/data/`, which is the
# *committed* knowledge-base corpus (see seed_kb.py / .gitignore line ~122).
/data/
/output/
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

